BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20130712T151745Z
DESCRIPTION:OK\, let's plan on 5 PM then (we are on eastern time\, same a
 s Michigan)\, for getting together\, and we'll have dinner soon after th
 at.  Casual dress.  Jeans are fine.  Our address is 16842 Dorrway Court\
 , Granger\, and we're about a mile from University Park mall.  If you ar
 e at the mall\, come north on Grape Road to Brick (stop sign 1 mile nort
 h of Cleveland).  Turn left on Brick and go about 3/10 of a mile to Lock
 s Lane (on your left).  If you get to Hickory (the 1st stop sign) you we
 nt a little too far.  Turn left on Locks\, and go to the 2nd court on th
 e left\, which is Dorrway Court.  Our house is the white one\, first on 
 the right in the court\, with green/blue/red trim and a big porch.  Park
  anywhere you can.  Home number is 574-277-3821 in case you have trouble
  finding us.
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20130727T170000
DTSTAMP:20130727T162057Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20130727T160000
LAST-MODIFIED:20130727T162050Z
