DESCRIPTION:\n \n \nFINE ARTS FAIR SCHEDULE - and Parents Volunteer to he
 lp Orchestra ?\nPosted by Vickie Marshall on Monday\, Feb 24 at 2:33 PM 
 in Orch 6 - 001 - Period 1\, Orch 6 - 002 - Period 3\, Orch 7 - 001 - Pe
 riod 6\, Orch 8 - 001 - Period 2\n\n \nHERE IS THE ORCHESTRA SCHEDULE OF
  THE FINE ARTS FAIR - Arrival and Performance TIMES.\n\n \n \n\nIf you w
 ould be willing to help "wrangle"\, line up\, place in order\, take atte
 ndance\, look over\, guide\, help\, support\, monitor\, de-gum\, settle 
 down\, quiet down\, calm down\, walk to the cafeteria and help them quic
 kly and quietly walk SINGLE FILE back after performing to the the orches
 tra room...😉😊\nour orchestra kiddos next Friday at the Fine Arts Fair 
 Festival\, when your child IS performing\, that would be FANTASTIC.  \nI
  could use 1 or 2 parents per grade.\n\nPlease contact me if you are int
 erested.\nThank you very much.\n- Vickie Marshall\nIMPORTANT  \n        
 Students enter Cafeteria on the RIGHT SIDE OF HALL\n            Students
  leave Cafeteria on the RIGHT SIDE OF THE HALL\n\n                      
   There must be QUIET in the HALLWAY while musicians are entering or pla
 ying in the cafe.\nThe  Orchestra schedule for the evening:\n5:30 - 6th 
 grade orchestra arrive/tune in the orchestra room\n5:55 - 6th grade orch
 estra move to stage\n6:00 -  7th grade orchestra arrive/tune - in orches
 tra room\n6:00 - 6:15pm - 6th grade Orchestra PERFORM \n6:15 - 6th grade
  walk back to orchestra room\, put instruments away and QUIETLY walk and
  leave the Fine Arts hall.\n                                     6:15 - 
 7th grade orchestra move to stage\n                                 6:20
 -6:35 - 7th grade Orchestra PERFORM\n                                 6:
 35 - 7th grade orchestra walk back to orchestra room\, put instruments a
 way and QUIETLY walk and leave the Fine Arts hall.\n6:20 - 8th grade arr
 ive/tune - in orchestra room\n6:35 - 8th grade move to stage\n6:40 - 8th
  grade Orchestra PERFORM\n6:55 - 8th grade orchestra walk back to orches
 tra room\, put instruments away and QUIETLY walk and leave the Fine Arts
  hall.
